//       docs/ANCHOR.oo 14/256
//       docs/SURFACE.oot 34/256
//       harness_wire.oo 214/256 (16 lines headroom — adding M3 alt-fix
//                                would push to 256/256, exactly at cap)
//       tests/hello_fixture.oo 13/256
//     All compliant.
//
// N4. VERSION SSoT. VERSION:1 = "0.1.30", `git describe --tags` =
//     "v0.1.30-9-g0795f78", openOODA/INDEX.oot:36 says "v0.1.30".
//     All three sources agree. RULES §1.24 satisfied.
//
// N5. detect_harnesses count. install.sh:511-532 detects 20 harnesses
//     (antigravity-cli, opencode, muse, grok, gemini, claude-code,
//     claude-desktop, cursor, windsurf, codex, cline, continue, zed,
//     vscode, goose, mistral-vibe, grok-build, devin, charm, mcode).
//     install/ANCHOR.oo:11 Beat 3 lists the same 20. The 20 list is
//     correct, only the wire count is wrong (see M1, M3).

